              <zone fixed-size="34" h="4048" id="9" is-fixed="true" type-v2="dashboard-object" w="18056" x="0" y="28810">
                <button action="tabdoc:goto-sheet window-id=&quot;{6CA5F50A-F933-5BF3-8781-E5AC90367C18}&quot;" button-type="text">
                  <button-visual-state>
                    <caption>ACTION QUEUE</caption>
                    <tooltip-text>Go to Action Queue</tooltip-text>
                    <button-caption-font-style bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontname="Tableau Medium" fontsize="9"/>
                    <format attr="background-color" value="#18222f"/>
                    <format attr="border-style" value="none"/>
                  </button-visual-state>
                </button>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr="border-style" value="none"/>
                  <format attr="border-width" value="0"/>
                  <format attr="margin" value="4"/>
                  <format attr="padding" value="0"/>
                  <format attr="background-color" value="#0a1119"/>
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size="564" h="67143" id="10" is-fixed="true" type-v2="text" w="18056" x="0" y="32857">
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold="true" fontcolor="#3fc1e8" fontsize="9">KEY TAKEAWAYS</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontsize="8">DISPATCH VS TRANSIT</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run fontcolor="#c3ccd6" fontsize="8">Late orders: 5.8 days seller dispatch + 25.7 days carrier transit. On-time orders: 3.0 + 7.9. About 86% of the extra 20.6 days is transit.</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontsize="8">SHIPPING LIMIT</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run fontcolor="#c3ccd6" fontsize="8">Sellers handed over after the shipping limit on 9.0% of orders; those were late 24.4% vs 6.5%. 27% of late orders had a missed limit.</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontsize="8">ROUTES</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run fontcolor="#c3ccd6" fontsize="8">SP → RJ is late 15.4% on 8,273 seller-orders, the largest excess of any route; SP → CE 15.2%, SP → BA 14.7%.</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontsize="8">SELLER STATES</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run fontcolor="#c3ccd6" fontsize="8">71% of seller-orders ship from SP (69,395 of 97,811), so route says more than seller state.</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontsize="8">GRAIN AND EXCLUSIONS</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run fontcolor="#c3ccd6" fontsize="8">Order x seller: 1,275 multi-seller orders (1.3%) count once per seller. 197 orders with missing or out-of-sequence hand-off dates are excluded from timing.</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run fontcolor="#8a97a6" fontsize="7">Source: Olist public data → PostgreSQL warehouse → CSV extracts (one grain per chart). Figures verified 2026-11-18.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr="border-style" value="none"/>
                  <format attr="border-width" value="0"/>
                  <format attr="margin" value="0"/>
                  <format attr="padding" value="16"/>
                  <format attr="background-color" value="#0a1119"/>
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr="border-style" value="none"/>
                <format attr="border-width" value="0"/>
                <format attr="margin" value="0"/>
                <format attr="padding" value="0"/>
                <format attr="background-color" value="#0a1119"/>
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size="1180" h="100000" id="11" is-fixed="true" param="vert" type-v2="layout-flow" w="81944" x="18056" y="0">
              <zone fixed-size="62" h="7381" id="12" is-fixed="true" type-v2="text" w="81389" x="18333" y="476">
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontsize="13">Late orders lose most of their time in carrier transit, not seller dispatch</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run fontcolor="#8a97a6" fontsize="8">Late orders: 25.7 transit vs 5.8 dispatch days (on time: 7.9 vs 3.0): ~86% of the extra 20.6 days is transit. Missed shipping limits (9.0% of orders): 24.4% late vs 6.5%. Associations.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr="border-style" value="none"/>
                  <format attr="border-width" value="0"/>
                  <format attr="margin" value="5"/>
                  <format attr="padding" value="12"/>
                  <format attr="background-color" value="#18222f"/>
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size="196" h="23333" id="13" is-fixed="true" param="horz" type-v2="layout-flow" w="81389" x="18333" y="7857">
                <zone fixed-size="372" h="23333" id="14" is-fixed="true" name="Ful Dispatch" w="25833" x="18333" y="7857">
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr="border-style" value="none"/>
                    <format attr="border-width" value="0"/>
                    <format attr="margin" value="5"/>
                    <format attr="padding" value="8"/>
                    <format attr="background-color" value="#18222f"/>
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size="372" h="23333" id="15" is-fixed="true" name="Ful Transit" w="25833" x="44167" y="7857">
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr="border-style" value="none"/>
                    <format attr="border-width" value="0"/>
                    <format attr="margin" value="5"/>
                    <format attr="padding" value="8"/>
                    <format attr="background-color" value="#18222f"/>
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size="428" h="23333" id="16" is-fixed="true" name="Ful Ship Limit" w="29722" x="70000" y="7857">
