                  <format attr="padding" value="0"/>
                  <format attr="background-color" value="#0a1119"/>
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size="564" h="67143" id="10" is-fixed="true" type-v2="text" w="18056" x="0" y="32857">
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold="true" fontcolor="#3fc1e8" fontsize="9">KEY TAKEAWAYS</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontsize="8">HOW TIERS WORK</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run fontcolor="#c3ccd6" fontsize="8">Priority: late rate 3+ pp above the network (8.11%) and 50+ excess late orders. Watch: 1+ pp above. Monitor: otherwise.</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontsize="8">PRIORITY STATES (6)</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run fontcolor="#c3ccd6" fontsize="8">RJ, BA, CE, MA, ES, AL: 1,176 excess late orders and R$426.7K of sales on late orders (3.2% of all sales).</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontsize="8">BIGGEST LEVER</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run fontcolor="#c3ccd6" fontsize="8">Rio de Janeiro alone accounts for 663 excess late orders (56% of the Priority total), on 12,351 orders.</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontsize="8">WATCH (8)</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run fontcolor="#c3ccd6" fontsize="8">PA, SC, PE, RN, SE, PI, PB, MS: 255 excess late orders combined.</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontsize="8">FIXED POPULATION</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run fontcolor="#c3ccd6" fontsize="8">Tiers and headline use all delivered orders in the 21 states with 300+ orders. Selecting a state filters only the monthly trend.</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run fontcolor="#8a97a6" fontsize="7">Source: Olist public data → PostgreSQL warehouse → CSV extracts (one grain per chart). Figures verified 2026-11-18.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr="border-style" value="none"/>
                  <format attr="border-width" value="0"/>
                  <format attr="margin" value="0"/>
                  <format attr="padding" value="16"/>
                  <format attr="background-color" value="#0a1119"/>
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr="border-style" value="none"/>
                <format attr="border-width" value="0"/>
                <format attr="margin" value="0"/>
                <format attr="padding" value="0"/>
                <format attr="background-color" value="#0a1119"/>
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size="1180" h="100000" id="11" is-fixed="true" param="vert" type-v2="layout-flow" w="81944" x="18056" y="0">
              <zone fixed-size="62" h="7381" id="12" is-fixed="true" type-v2="text" w="81389" x="18333" y="476">
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontsize="13">Six priority states hold 1,176 excess late orders. Rio de Janeiro alone has 663 (56%)</run>
                  <run>Æ
</run>
                  <run fontcolor="#8a97a6" fontsize="8">Excess late orders = late orders - delivered orders x network late rate (8.11%). Fixed population: 21 states with 300+ delivered orders, Sep 2016 - Aug 2018. Selection does not change the headline.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr="border-style" value="none"/>
                  <format attr="border-width" value="0"/>
                  <format attr="margin" value="5"/>
                  <format attr="padding" value="12"/>
                  <format attr="background-color" value="#18222f"/>
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size="770" h="91667" id="13" is-fixed="true" param="horz" type-v2="layout-flow" w="81389" x="18333" y="7857">
                <zone fixed-size="774" h="91667" id="14" is-fixed="true" name="Action States" w="53750" x="18333" y="7857">
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr="border-style" value="none"/>
                    <format attr="border-width" value="0"/>
                    <format attr="margin" value="5"/>
                    <format attr="padding" value="8"/>
                    <format attr="background-color" value="#18222f"/>
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size="398" h="91667" id="15" is-fixed="true" param="vert" type-v2="layout-flow" w="27639" x="72083" y="7857">
                  <zone fixed-size="300" h="35714" id="16" is-fixed="true" name="Action State Trend" w="27639" x="72083" y="7857">
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr="border-style" value="none"/>
                      <format attr="border-width" value="0"/>
                      <format attr="margin" value="5"/>
                      <format attr="padding" value="8"/>
                      <format attr="background-color" value="#18222f"/>
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone fixed-size="470" h="55952" id="17" is-fixed="true" type-v2="text" w="27639" x="72083" y="43571">
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold="true" fontcolor="#3fc1e8" fontsize="9">PLAYBOOK</run>
                      <run>Æ
</run>
                      <run>Æ
</run>
                      <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontsize="8">1  OWNER</run>
                      <run>Æ
</run>
                      <run fontcolor="#c3ccd6" fontsize="8">Logistics / carrier management lead (owner to be confirmed by the business).</run>
                      <run>Æ
</run>
                      <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontsize="8">2  ACTION</run>
                      <run>Æ
</run>
                      <run fontcolor="#c3ccd6" fontsize="8">For Priority states: review carrier performance and the estimated-date setting per state; consider longer promised dates where carriers cannot meet them.</run>
                      <run>Æ
</run>
                      <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontsize="8">3  TRIGGER</run>
                      <run>Æ
</run>
                      <run fontcolor="#c3ccd6" fontsize="8">A state's monthly late rate is 3+ pp above the network rate for 2 consecutive months.</run>
                      <run>Æ
</run>
                      <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontsize="8">4  SUCCESS MEASURE</run>
                      <run>Æ
</run>
                      <run fontcolor="#c3ccd6" fontsize="8">Excess late orders and late rate per state, monthly; guardrail: avg review and delivered-order volume.</run>
                      <run>Æ
</run>
                      <run bold="true" fontcolor="#f2f5f8" fontsize="8">5  NEXT INVESTIGATION</run>
                      <run>Æ
</run>
                      <run fontcolor="#c3ccd6" fontsize="8">Seller &amp; Fulfilment shows most extra delay is carrier transit. Next: carrier-level performance on the worst routes (e.g. SP → RJ).</run>
                      <run>Æ
</run>
                      <run>Æ
</run>
                      <run fontcolor="#8a97a6" fontsize="7">Recommendations are hypotheses from measured data, not proven causes.</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr="border-style" value="none"/>
                      <format attr="border-width" value="0"/>
                      <format attr="margin" value="5"/>
                      <format attr="padding" value="14"/>
                      <format attr="background-color" value="#18222f"/>
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr="border-style" value="none"/>
                    <format attr="border-width" value="0"/>
                    <format attr="margin" value="0"/>
                    <format attr="padding" value="0"/>
                  </zone-style>
